    title: "Python dotted bases of IN-TREE modules (models.Model) and class-namespace bases (Outer.Meta) are still bound by last segment in the core linker, with a sorted-id fallback (django: 3022 fallback extends edges; a wrong pretix Meta)"  # 46de
