  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. py.py still `continue`s a dotted base that is in-tree (py.py ~3256) so the core inheritance linker binds it. WI-pivap 8001c9f1da (2026-10-18) added _qualifier_fit to inheritance.py but a Python candidate's qualname 'Model' fits 'models.Model', so Python is unchanged. Fixture fx_vipir: `from mylib.db import models; class M(models.Model)` -> a_other/stuff.py Model (conf 0.5, disambiguation_fallback) instead of mylib/db/models.py Model; `class Meta(OrderPositionSerializer.Meta)` in a file with another nested Meta -> unrelated a_other/stuff.py Meta (fallback); alone in its file -> no edge. Both reproduce. MECHANISM: in-tree dotted base deferred to the core linker, which binds the last segment by name (qualifier-fit passes because a Python qualname is a suffix) with sorted-id fallback. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kazut,WI-pituk."  # 3b18
